#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:18
msgid "Publishing to the Central Repo"
msgstr ""
"发布到中央仓库"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:21
msgid ""
"```admonish note\n"
"The recipe section of the documentation focuses on the objectives\n"
"with minimal explanations.\n"
"\n"
"See also Sonatype's [Publish guides][sonatype-central-portal-register] for "
"general concepts around publishing to the Central Portal.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```admonish note\n"
"文档中的食谱部分以最少说明聚焦于目标。\n"
"\n"
"向 Central Portal 发布的一般概念，另请参阅 Sonatype 的 [Publish guides](https://central.sonatype.org/register/central-portal/)。\n"
"```"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:28
msgid "Objective"
msgstr ""
"目标"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:31
msgid "I want to publish my project to the Central Repository."
msgstr ""
"我想将项目发布到中央仓库。"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:34
msgid "Steps"
msgstr ""
"步骤"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:37
msgid "Preliminary 1: Central Portal registration"
msgstr ""
"准备 1：Central Portal 注册"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:39
msgid ""
"Create a Central Portal account, following Sonatype's [Publish guides]"
"(https://central.sonatype.org/register/central-portal/)."
msgstr ""
"请按 Sonatype 的 [Publish guides](https://central.sonatype.org/register/central-portal/) 创建 Central Portal 账户。"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:41
msgid ""
"If you had an OSSRH account, use **Forgot password** flow to convert the "
"account to the new Central Portal, which lets you keep the previous "
"namespace associations."
msgstr ""
"若您曾有 OSSRH 账户，请使用 **Forgot password** 流程将账户迁移到新的 Central Portal，"
"以保留此前的命名空间关联。"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:42
msgid ""
"If you authenticate via GitHub, `io.github.<user_name>` will automatically "
"be associated with the account."
msgstr ""
"若通过 GitHub 认证，`io.github.<user_name>` 会自动关联到该账户。"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:44
msgid ""
"Follow the steps described in [register a namespace](https://"
"central.sonatype.org/register/namespace/) guide to associate a domain name "
"with your account."
msgstr ""
"请按 [register a namespace](https://central.sonatype.org/register/namespace/) 指南中的步骤，"
"将域名与您的账户关联。"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:47
msgid "Preliminary 2: PGP key pair"
msgstr ""
"准备 2：PGP 密钥对"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:49
msgid ""
"Follow the Sonatype's [GPG guide](https://central.sonatype.org/publish/"
"requirements/gpg/) to generate a PGP key pair."
msgstr ""
"请按 Sonatype 的 [GPG guide](https://central.sonatype.org/publish/requirements/gpg/) 生成 PGP 密钥对。"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:51
msgid ""
"[Install GnuPG](https://www.gnupg.org/download/), and verify the version:"
msgstr ""
"[安装 GnuPG](https://www.gnupg.org/download/)，并确认版本："

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:61
msgid "Next generate a key:"
msgstr ""
"接下来生成密钥："

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:67
msgid "List the keys:"
msgstr ""
"列出密钥："

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:81
msgid "Distribute the key:"
msgstr ""
"分发密钥："

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:87
msgid "Step 1: sbt-pgp"
msgstr ""
"步骤 1：sbt-pgp"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:89
msgid ""
"The [sbt-pgp plugin](https://github.com/sbt/sbt-pgp#sbt-pgp) can sign the "
"published artifacts with GPG/PGP. (Optionally [sbt-ci-release](https://"
"github.com/sbt/sbt-ci-release) can automate the publishing process.)"
msgstr ""
"[sbt-pgp 插件](https://github.com/sbt/sbt-pgp#sbt-pgp) 可用 GPG/PGP 为发布的工件签名。"
"（也可选用 [sbt-ci-release](https://github.com/sbt/sbt-ci-release) 自动化发布流程。）"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:92
msgid ""
"Add the following line to your `project/plugins.sbt` file to enable it for "
"your build:"
msgstr ""
"将以下一行加入 `project/plugins.sbt`，以便在构建中启用："

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:96
msgid "\"com.github.sbt\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:96
msgid "\"sbt-pgp\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:96
msgid "\"2.3.1\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:99
msgid ""
"```admonish note\n"
"Make sure that the `gpg` command is in PATH available to the sbt.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```admonish note\n"
"请确保 sbt 可用的 PATH 中包含 `gpg` 命令。\n"
"```"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:103
msgid "Step 2: Credentials"
msgstr ""
"步骤 2：凭据"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:105
msgid ""
"Generate a user token from the portal to be used for the credentials. The "
"token must be stored somewhere safe (NOT in the repository)."
msgstr ""
"在门户中生成用于凭据的用户令牌。令牌须保存在安全位置（不要放在仓库中）。"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:108
msgid ""
"sbt 2.x can also reads from the environment variables `SONATYPE_USERNAME` "
"and `SONATYPE_PASSWORD` and appends a credential for `central.sonatype.com` "
"out-of-box, which might be useful for automatic publishing from the CI "
"environment, such as GitHub Actions."
msgstr ""
"sbt 2.x 还可读取环境变量 `SONATYPE_USERNAME` 和 `SONATYPE_PASSWORD`，并开箱即为 "
"`central.sonatype.com` 追加凭据，便于在 CI 环境（如 GitHub Actions）中自动发布。"

