msgstr ""
"在 sbt shell 中执行："

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:200
msgid "Step 5: Upload or release the bundle"
msgstr ""
"步骤 5：上传或发布 bundle"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:208
msgid ""
"This will upload the bundle to the [Central Portal](https://"
"central.sonatype.com/). Hit the \"Publish\" button to publish to the Central "
"Repository."
msgstr ""
"这会将 bundle 上传到 [Central Portal](https://central.sonatype.com/)。点击 \"Publish\" 按钮即可发布到中央仓库。"

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:211
msgid "If you want to automate the publishing, run:"
msgstr ""
"若要自动化发布，请执行："

#: src/reference/recipes/central.md:217
msgid ""
"It might take 10 minutes to a few hours for the published artifacts to be "
